sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Agent or user
    participant D as Deletion service
    participant U as Dedicated user confirmation
    participant R as Registry and journal
    participant F as Filesystem adapter
    A->>D: Propose exact primary repository deletion
    D->>R: Resolve root identity references and active users
    R-->>D: Revisioned dependency snapshot
    D->>U: Preview exact local removal and retained records
    Note over A,U: Agent operation approval cannot confirm this action
    U->>D: User confirms bound target and snapshot
    D->>R: Fence dependent admissions and journal intent
    D->>D: Stop and reconcile active use
    D->>R: Recheck identity references and confirmation
    alt Target changed or users unresolved
        R-->>D: Block without enlarging target
        D-->>U: Changed proposal needs review
    else Confirmed target still valid
        R-->>D: Admit typed deletion
        D->>F: Guard roots and use stable handles
        alt Partial filesystem failure
            F-->>D: Actual removed and remaining targets
            D->>R: Save partial outcome and recovery state
        else Completed
            F-->>D: Confirmed local source removed
            D->>R: Save completion and preserve history
        end
        D-->>U: Actual outcome and retained remote history artifacts
    end
    Note over D,F: Drive and filesystem roots always remain blocked
